## Summary of the request path

`POST /api/owners` is served by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner(...)`, which implements the OpenAPI-generated `OwnersApi` interface. The request body is an `OwnerFieldsDto`. Bean Validation runs first (from `@Valid` on the interface), then a chain of manual controller-level validations and normalizations, then MapStruct mapping to the `Owner` JPA entity, then persistence via `ClinicService` → Spring Data JPA. Below is the verbatim code, in the order things execute.

