## 1. The endpoint mapping (generated interface)

The POST /owners mapping and the `@Valid @RequestBody` binding live in the generated interface, not the controller.

`/home/daniel/sandbox/target/generated-sources/openapi/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/api/OwnersApi.java` (lines 44-46, 52, 79-87):

