The exception types are defined in the same package: `MissingOwnerFieldsException.java`, `InvalidOwnerFieldsException.java`, `DuplicateOwnerTelephoneException.java`, `DuplicateOwnerHouseholdException.java` (all under `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/advice/`). Their full source is quoted above in the tool results; each is a simple `RuntimeException` carrying the offending field(s)/value(s).

There are no custom `ConstraintValidator` classes for owners. The only custom validator in the repo is `PetAgeValidator`/`PetAgeValidation` under `rest/validation/`, which applies to pets, not owners.

